== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] who follows Isaac around and fires normal tears {{dlcalt|once per second that each do 3.5 damage|r=1.36 times per second that each do 6 damage}}.
** These tears appear red, but have no special effects.
* {{transformation contribution|Conjoined}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Sister Maggy is functionally identical to {{i|Brother Bobby}}.
* {{dlc|r}} Sister Maggy deals more damage than {{i|Brother Bobby}}, while Brother Bobby has a higher tear rate.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Sister Maggy having {{dlcalt|5th|r+=7th}} priority.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Mongo Baby}}: Will copy Sister Maggy’s tears.

